I've made the following changes to fix the error:

1. Added the missing `categories` array to the app object, which was causing the error when trying to access `app.categories[0]`
2. Added other required properties that the AppCard component expects:
   - `isInstalled`
   - `enabled`
   - `credentials`
   - `isSetupAlready`

These changes should resolve the "Cannot read properties of undefined (reading '0')" error because now the `categories` array exists and has at least one element that can be accessed at index 0.

The error was occurring because the AppCard component was trying to display the first category of the app in the UI, but the categories array was missing in our mock data. With these additions, the component should now render correctly.

